// Windows resource script: embeds app.ico as the executable's icon. Resource ID 1 is
// the Win32 convention both Explorer (lowest-ID icon group = the .exe file's shown
// icon) and GLFW (its Win32 backend loads MAKEINTRESOURCE(1) as the window/taskbar
// icon by default - see win32_platform.h's GLFW_ICON) pick up automatically, so no
// runtime glfwSetWindowIcon() call is needed alongside this.
1 ICON "app.ico"
